#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This Procedure demonstrates how to use Events and VS Commands to simulate a Reverse Spin. The VS Commands are used to define three new variables, and these variables are used as triggers in the Event series.
#
#Studying the driver controls on this screen, we see that the vehicle is travelling in reverse at full throttle. In the Events, once we reach a set speed (vx_r), we spin the vehicle around and change the shift control from Reverse to "AT All Gears" (i.e., NGEARS).
#
#The test continues until we reach a maximum speed (vx_max).
#
#To see how this was done, click on the Events blue link "A. Reverse to "vx_r" km/h"."
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

